; Pure type and protocol definitions shared between the PISS
; backend (src/) and, eventually, the PISS browser shell (web/).
;
; Anything that depends on IO (filesystem access, SQLite stores,
; network requests) belongs in src/lib/ as part of `piss.core`,
; not here. This library compiles for the native OCaml target;
; the browser shell will consume its types once the Melange toolchain
; supports a shared JSON library (today Melange cannot link against
; the nixpkgs yojson; that lands separately).

(library
 (name piss_shared)
 (public_name piss.shared)
 (libraries yojson)
 (wrapped true))
